sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser as Metriczone Elevator Lab
    participant Server as Existing C HTTP server
    participant Runtime as C simulation
    participant DB as Embedded SQLite
    User->>Browser: Open the existing simulator URL
    Browser->>Server: GET interface, local logo and styles
    Server-->>Browser: Metriczone identity assets
    Browser->>Server: GET authoritative elevator state
    Server-->>Browser: Cabin, passengers, run and recent events
    Browser->>Browser: Render teal controls, measurement cards and live sequence
    User->>Browser: Add a passenger or operate the elevator
    Browser->>Server: POST existing command API
    Server->>Runtime: Apply validated command
    Runtime->>DB: Persist telemetry through the existing recorder
    Server-->>Browser: Updated state
    User->>Browser: Explore telemetry or architecture and sequence history
    Browser->>Server: GET existing telemetry APIs or generated diagrams
    Server-->>Browser: Preserved experiment history or selected stage snapshot
